sequenceDiagram
    actor Human as User
    participant UI as Agent Director UI
    participant CTX as Project context
    participant RT as Local Director runtime
    participant BP as Edit Blueprint
    participant POL as Approval policy
    participant TL as Timeline engine
    participant HIST as History and manifest
    participant FUTURE as Future media workers

    Human->>UI: Describe the desired outcome
    UI->>CTX: Read media, selection, tracks, and sequence
    CTX-->>RT: agentcut-context-v2
    RT->>RT: Classify full-edit intent
    RT->>BP: Build source, target, ordered steps, and readiness
    BP-->>UI: Show blueprint and held analysis work
    Human->>POL: Approve once for the complete mission
    POL-->>RT: Approval granted
    RT->>TL: Execute agent.full-edit composite command
    TL->>TL: Add source, set target, preserve locks
    TL->>HIST: Record before/after snapshots and audit entry
    HIST-->>UI: Progress, mission log, and undo
    RT-->>UI: Reviewable edit timeline
    FUTURE-->>BP: Future transcript, audio, vision, or render evidence
